IT:
A proposito, i nomi dei fossili
sono scritti accanto alle copie
nella {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}sala modello{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Per vedere il nome di un fossile,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
basta avvicinarsi alla sua copia{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
e premere !

EN:
Also,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} as long as it's not a fossil,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
you can take home anything you
find here on the island!
If you need some other tools,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
go rent them from {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Lloid{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

